.agents/adr/0022-an-agreed-divergence-is-never-delivered-over.md
.agents/adr/0023-local-mode-is-a-harness-config-knob.md
.agents/adr/0024-product-content-is-not-an-artifact.md
.claude/commands/
# must follow .agents/skills/ — .claude/skills/<name> is a relative symlink into it.
